{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Dungeon Finder: a full group that left its dungeon unfinished can queue again",
  "contract": [
    "A full Dungeon Finder group whose dungeon is unfinished counts as continuing it, and LFGMgr::JoinLfg refuses a full group's continuation with LFG_JOIN_PARTY_NOT_MEET_REQS, so it could not queue again until it disbanded.",
    "Once every member has left the dungeon, LFGMgr::ReleaseAbandonedDungeon marks the run finished and drops the members' binds to that map, so the next queue starts a new role check and match like after a completed dungeon.",
    "The random dungeon cooldown (71328) from the first run is removed so that only the abandoned-run rule decides the second queue."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
